        {
          "text": "Bonke abanami bayakhonza kuwe. Bingelela abasithandayo ekukholweni. Umusa mawube nani nonke. Amen. (Yabhalelwa uThithu, owagcotshwa umbhishobhi wokuqala webandla lamaKrethe, waseNikopoli yaseMakedoniya.)",
          "type": "text",
